            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Agent connections

- Automatic connections are selected by default when reviewing a new Grok Bot setup. Saving the setup enables them for that project and account. Weft remembers when you turn the option off.
- Choose a terminal in Settings for resuming agent sessions. With Ghostty selected, Weft opens the saved session in a new tab when a window is already open.
]]></description>
